1
00:00:33,908 --> 00:00:35,994
Yujun.

2
00:00:35,994 --> 00:00:38,246
I like you.

3
00:00:38,246 --> 00:00:41,374
Enough to give you my everything.

4
00:00:41,374 --> 00:00:42,167
I like you.

5
00:00:42,459 --> 00:00:44,252
I said that's enough.

6
00:00:45,587 --> 00:00:46,921
When did you wake up?

7
00:00:52,343 --> 00:00:55,138
Since you started staring at me.

8
00:01:19,204 --> 00:01:20,622
I have to head out early.

9
00:01:21,539 --> 00:01:22,999
You still have time.

10
00:01:23,166 --> 00:01:24,793
I have a first-period class today.

11
00:01:24,793 --> 00:01:26,419
And Professor Han asked me for a favor.

12
00:01:37,347 --> 00:01:38,139
Happy?

13
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:40,892
That felt a bit obligatory, don't you think?

14
00:01:42,477 --> 00:01:43,937
I'll come home early.

15
00:01:49,818 --> 00:01:51,444
Are you dropping me off again?

16
00:01:51,444 --> 00:01:53,446
Yeah, of course.

17
00:01:53,446 --> 00:01:55,240
So hurry up and wash up.

18
00:01:57,659 --> 00:01:58,201
Hurry.

19
00:01:58,201 --> 00:01:59,744
Go on.

20
00:02:12,465 --> 00:02:14,676
Don't you get tired of dropping me off every time?

21
00:02:14,676 --> 00:02:15,969
I can go by myself.

22
00:02:16,219 --> 00:02:18,805
I'm dropping you off, why would I be tired?

23
00:02:18,805 --> 00:02:20,890
Your unemployed boyfriend should at least be your chauffeur.

24
00:02:22,308 --> 00:02:23,393
What do you mean, unemployed?

25
00:02:23,393 --> 00:02:24,853
You're just taking a short break.

26
00:02:25,562 --> 00:02:26,813
Hmm?

27
00:02:30,233 --> 00:02:31,651
It's going to scab over.

28
00:02:32,694 --> 00:02:33,862
You're the one who did it.

29
00:02:39,742 --> 00:02:40,869
I told you not to.

30
00:02:41,286 --> 00:02:43,163
This is my only joy these days.

31
00:02:46,833 --> 00:02:48,668
(Jiseok) I'm ready.

32
00:02:53,089 --> 00:02:53,840
What is it?

33
00:02:55,091 --> 00:02:56,551
It's nothing.

34
00:02:58,052 --> 00:02:58,761
Kim Yeonho.

35
00:02:59,304 --> 00:03:00,430
Later.

36
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:01,598
I'll tell you later.

37
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:07,812
You're going to be late.

38
00:03:10,231 --> 00:03:11,524
Are you really not going to tell me?

39
00:03:12,442 --> 00:03:13,693
Whatever you're thinking,

40
00:03:13,693 --> 00:03:14,903
or whatever you're worrying about,

41
00:03:14,903 --> 00:03:16,613
it's not like that.

42
00:03:16,613 --> 00:03:19,324
I'm not cheating on you.

43
00:03:19,324 --> 00:03:20,700
Who else would I look at besides you?

44
00:03:22,202 --> 00:03:24,245
Who said anything about cheating?

45
00:03:26,414 --> 00:03:29,667
It was written all over your face.

46
00:03:29,667 --> 00:03:31,127
Hurry up and go.

47
00:03:33,588 --> 00:03:36,257
Yeah, I'm going.

48
00:03:36,382 --> 00:03:37,217
Yeah.

49
00:03:37,217 --> 00:03:38,885
I'll come pick you up tonight.

50
00:03:57,153 --> 00:03:59,739
When should we meet?

51
00:04:01,658 --> 00:04:03,743
The sooner the better for me.

52
00:04:03,743 --> 00:04:05,286
Since it's you I'm seeing, Yeonho.

53
00:04:12,335 --> 00:04:14,796
What will you say?

54
00:04:14,796 --> 00:04:18,466
How will you react?

55
00:04:22,387 --> 00:04:23,680
It doesn't even show.

56
00:04:33,690 --> 00:04:34,524
What is it?

57
00:04:35,733 --> 00:04:37,235
It's nothing.

58
00:04:38,695 --> 00:04:39,445
Kim Yeonho.

59
00:04:39,946 --> 00:04:41,072
Later.

60
00:04:41,072 --> 00:04:42,824
I'll tell you later.

61
00:04:43,783 --> 00:04:45,493
You said you'd be a cool boyfriend.

62
00:04:45,493 --> 00:04:48,371
Why can't you be cool?

63
00:05:02,593 --> 00:05:03,970
As if Kim Yeonho would ever cheat.

64
00:05:14,105 --> 00:05:15,189
Come in.

65
00:05:17,608 --> 00:05:19,193
Here are the materials you asked for.

66
00:05:21,195 --> 00:05:23,197
You could have just emailed them.

67
00:05:23,740 --> 00:05:26,284
The file size was too big.

68
00:05:26,284 --> 00:05:28,244
And I wanted an excuse to see you, Professor.

69
00:05:31,497 --> 00:05:33,624
I'm a fan of yours, Professor.

70
00:05:36,127 --> 00:05:37,503
I read the thesis you published as a grad student,

71
00:05:37,503 --> 00:05:39,047
and applied to this school because of it.

72
00:05:42,592 --> 00:05:45,803
Could I ask for your autograph?

73
00:05:49,098 --> 00:05:51,059
Is it really worth getting an autograph?

74
00:05:51,184 --> 00:05:51,809
Of course.

75
00:05:51,809 --> 00:05:54,395
It even made me want to become a grad student.

76
00:05:54,771 --> 00:05:56,356
Aren't you still a freshman, Sueon?

77
00:05:56,773 --> 00:05:58,733
That's right.

78
00:05:58,733 --> 00:06:01,694
But if I could work with you, Professor,

79
00:06:01,694 --> 00:06:03,654
I'm more than ready to become a grad student.

80
00:06:04,447 --> 00:06:06,199
The research materials on AI technology...

81
00:06:06,199 --> 00:06:07,992
...are fun to read no matter how many times I read them.

82
00:06:10,620 --> 00:06:11,746
You're the first person I've met...

83
00:06:11,746 --> 00:06:12,580
...who found it fun to read.

84
00:06:12,789 --> 00:06:14,290
By the way, where did you get this book?

85
00:06:14,374 --> 00:06:16,250
It was really hard to find.

86
00:06:16,250 --> 00:06:17,794
You didn't print that many copies.

87
00:06:18,169 --> 00:06:19,962
Right.

88
00:06:19,962 --> 00:06:21,756
Because there aren't many people who would buy...

89
00:06:21,756 --> 00:06:25,593
...a thesis book published by a grad student.

90
00:06:25,593 --> 00:06:26,677
Should I sign here?

91
00:06:26,844 --> 00:06:29,305
Yes. Thank you.

92
00:06:34,435 --> 00:06:34,894
Yes?

93
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:39,023
Yeonho.

94
00:06:40,066 --> 00:06:41,692
Hello.

95
00:06:41,692 --> 00:06:43,111
I don't think we've met properly.

96
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,446
You know Yeonho?

97
00:06:48,241 --> 00:06:50,868
I've seen him drop you off in the mornings,

98
00:06:50,868 --> 00:06:53,413
so I guess I felt a sense of familiarity.

99
00:06:53,621 --> 00:06:56,374
I saw you getting out of his car.

100
00:06:56,374 --> 00:06:57,917
He's a friend, right?

101
00:06:58,501 --> 00:06:59,752
Yes, he's a friend.

102
00:07:00,336 --> 00:07:01,337
Here's your book.

103
00:07:01,546 --> 00:07:02,380
You should get going now.

104
00:07:02,380 --> 00:07:03,965
Thank you.

105
00:07:03,965 --> 00:07:07,343
See you next time.

106
00:07:14,434 --> 00:07:15,059
Yujun.

107
00:07:16,352 --> 00:07:18,271
Don't even touch me when we're outside.

108
00:07:22,900 --> 00:07:24,777
Yujun...

109
00:07:25,486 --> 00:07:27,280
Go home.

110
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:29,782
I have a class, so I have to go.

111
00:07:38,916 --> 00:07:39,500
Seriously.

112
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:40,918
I promise.

113
00:07:40,918 --> 00:07:42,336
I really won't lay a hand on you.

114
00:07:43,337 --> 00:07:46,132
Alright.

115
00:07:51,554 --> 00:07:53,931
I was thinking we could go on a date today.

116
00:08:01,772 --> 00:08:03,232
Go inside and sleep.

117
00:08:09,864 --> 00:08:11,240
I thought you said you wouldn't touch me.

118
00:08:11,741 --> 00:08:13,534
But we're at home.

119
00:08:23,044 --> 00:08:24,879
This is way better than a date.

120
00:08:41,979 --> 00:08:43,022
Where are you going?

121
00:08:46,025 --> 00:08:47,276
I'll be right back.

122
00:08:47,443 --> 00:08:48,528
Suddenly?

123
00:08:48,528 --> 00:08:49,570
Where are you going?

124
00:08:49,737 --> 00:08:51,781
Someone asked to see me.

125
00:08:51,781 --> 00:08:53,032
I'll be back soon.

126
00:08:58,579 --> 00:08:59,330
Right now?

127
00:09:05,211 --> 00:09:06,295
Understood.

128
00:09:06,879 --> 00:09:09,048
Yes.

129
00:09:20,810 --> 00:09:22,353
Go to sleep first if I'm late.
